{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/a9f5b6189962ac888b852fed9018f8ea.poster.avif?t=1755435100\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/a9f5b6189962ac888b852fed9018f8ea.webm?t=1755435100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/a9f5b6189962ac888b852fed9018f8ea.mp4?t=1755435100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Become a Plantiquarian!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plantiquarian is a First-Person 3D Exploration and Puzzle Game, in which you can collect a myriad of mysterious and magical plants - each with their own quirks and abilities! Consult your trusty Encyclopedia to first find, and then figure out how to uproot each specimen.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/a6926b19ebb297bf88433d62b92d44b5.poster.avif?t=1755435100\" width=780 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/a6926b19ebb297bf88433d62b92d44b5.webm?t=1755435100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/a6926b19ebb297bf88433d62b92d44b5.mp4?t=1755435100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Forest</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax as you explore a magical forest at nighttime. With the eternally starry sky above your head and beautiful vegetation surrounding you, there's no need to rush! Follow glowing butterflies, flowers, crystals and more to investigate the area. As you discover points of interest, you will naturally come across various plant specimens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/5e044ca3193055fdb7c742e3ef6acbd6.poster.avif?t=1755435100\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/5e044ca3193055fdb7c742e3ef6acbd6.webm?t=1755435100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/5e044ca3193055fdb7c742e3ef6acbd6.mp4?t=1755435100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Plant Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consult your Encyclopedia as you search for plants. Poetic entries give hints to the locations, needs and abilities of each plant - read carefully to solve these puzzles and expand your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/7fccf7b7e4baa317679ff63d8669b377.poster.avif?t=1755435100\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/7fccf7b7e4baa317679ff63d8669b377.webm?t=1755435100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/7fccf7b7e4baa317679ff63d8669b377.mp4?t=1755435100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Plants</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you collect more and more plants, they will send a  beam of light to the sky, a glowing waypoint so you don't lose them. Placing them on the stone slabs at your home base also seems to do something... Are you ready to collect every single plant and find out what that could be?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921630?t=1755435100","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921630?t=1755435100","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/370a76d3c883f99ecf100b0755243bf0ed0cac09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755435100","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/370a76d3c883f99ecf100b0755243bf0ed0cac09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755435100","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/a9f5b6189962ac888b852fed9018f8ea.poster.avif?t=1755435100\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/a9f5b6189962ac888b852fed9018f8ea.webm?t=1755435100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/a9f5b6189962ac888b852fed9018f8ea.mp4?t=1755435100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Become a Plantiquarian!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plantiquarian is a First-Person 3D Exploration and Puzzle Game, in which you can collect a myriad of mysterious and magical plants - each with their own quirks and abilities! Consult your trusty Encyclopedia to first find, and then figure out how to uproot each specimen.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"b