paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/7fccf7b7e4baa317679ff63d8669b377.poster.avif?t=1755435100\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/7fccf7b7e4baa317679ff63d8669b377.webm?t=1755435100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/extras/7fccf7b7e4baa317679ff63d8669b377.mp4?t=1755435100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Plants</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you collect more and more plants, they will send a  beam of light to the sky, a glowing waypoint so you don't lose them. Placing them on the stone slabs at your home base also seems to do something... Are you ready to collect every single plant and find out what that could be?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Six Goblins"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921630/8238a3832c92ab7d0649529c849a1f522490bea7/header.jpg?t=1755435100","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3921630/64967769/5fd83a91171b09e2fdfa39b98c90b5f5e31a2416/1754402230/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755260775","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3921630/64967769/5fd83a91171b09e2fdfa39b98c90b5f5e31a2416/1754402230/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755260775","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3921630/64967769/5fd83a91171b09e2fdfa39b98c90b5f5e31a2416/1754402230/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755260775","id":257178562,"name":"Plantiquarian | Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"http